\f0\b0  $11.25 \\times 2 = 22.50$, $11.25 / 2 = 5.625$, and $11.25 / 3 = 3.750$. This exact linear integer relationship proves that the non-linear asymmetry in your SST series stems directly from the periodic driver rather than random noise.\uc0\u8232 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
